IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `spr-part4-qualifying-years`

-- Tests for regulation 13 (spr-part4-qualifying-years.l4).
-- Text: "the minimum number of qualifying years for a state pension payable at the
-- reduced rate is ten" (13(1)) and "... at the transitional rate is ten" (13(2)).

§ `Regulation 13: the figures`

#ASSERT `regulation 13(1): the minimum number of qualifying years for a state pension at the reduced rate` EQUALS 10
#ASSERT `regulation 13(2): the minimum number of qualifying years for a state pension at the transitional rate` EQUALS 10

§ `Regulation 13: each side of the threshold`

-- Nine years is below ten; ten and eleven are not.
#ASSERT `regulation 13: whether the person has the minimum number of qualifying years` `a state pension at the reduced rate` 9 EQUALS `the person does not have enough qualifying years`
#ASSERT `regulation 13: whether the person has the minimum number of qualifying years` `a state pension at the reduced rate` 10 EQUALS `the person has enough qualifying years`
#ASSERT `regulation 13: whether the person has the minimum number of qualifying years` `a state pension at the reduced rate` 11 EQUALS `the person has enough qualifying years`
#ASSERT `regulation 13: whether the person has the minimum number of qualifying years` `a state pension at the reduced rate` 0 EQUALS `the person does not have enough qualifying years`
#ASSERT `regulation 13: whether the person has the minimum number of qualifying years` `a state pension at the transitional rate` 9 EQUALS `the person does not have enough qualifying years`
#ASSERT `regulation 13: whether the person has the minimum number of qualifying years` `a state pension at the transitional rate` 10 EQUALS `the person has enough qualifying years`
#ASSERT `regulation 13: whether the person has the minimum number of qualifying years` `a state pension at the transitional rate` 35 EQUALS `the person has enough qualifying years`

§ `The full rate: not covered by these Regulations`

-- The number of qualifying years for the full rate is not in this text.
#ASSERT `regulation 13: whether the person has the minimum number of qualifying years` `a state pension at the full rate` 35 EQUALS `these Regulations do not set the number of qualifying years for this rate`
#ASSERT `regulation 13: whether the person has the minimum number of qualifying years` `a state pension at the full rate` 0 EQUALS `these Regulations do not set the number of qualifying years for this rate`
